        {
          "text": "na ala matalilwe mosyaanĩonĩ ma athembi kwĩanana na nyũmba sya aaĩthe moo, vamwe na Alivai ala mavikĩtye myaka mĩongo ĩlĩ na mbee, mawĩanĩ moo kũatĩĩa nguthu syoo; ",
